{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of orphans trapped in a sinister orphanage, set in Cold War-era Eastern Europe. They have to escape, before they are sacrificed by a ruthless cult attempting to summon Moloch, the Child Eater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/GIF_SOLVE_PUZZLES_TOGETHER.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ce_key_features.png?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer survival horror for 1-6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic escape room mechanics where every session is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hallucinatory horror engine that blurs reality and fear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three-phase gameplay: Phase 1: main building (demo) -&gt; Phase 2: wings -&gt; Phase 3: forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hostile enemies: turned priests, nuns, s\u00e9ance monsters, Child Eater</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character progression &amp; lore will unlock over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic 1980s eastern bloc environment, featuring pop-cultural and Cold War collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural puzzle-chain system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/GIF_HORROR_MONSTERS_SURVIVAL_COOP_MULTIPLAYER.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ce_game_objectives.png?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the orphanage</strong> before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay low, stay quiet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find clues, solve puzzles, and unlock the path to freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up and survive the horror together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/steamcoop.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ce_story.png?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is set in Eastern Europe in the early 1980s. The orphans (players) must figure out how to escape alive from an orphanage that harbors terrible, evil secrets. The caretakers, priests and nuns, are members of a satanic cult and the time has come for the final s\u00e9ance where all the orphans are to be sacrificed to unleash demonic forces on the world and bring demonic power to earth by the &quot;Child Eater&quot;. Secret story elements are revealed by playing through the game multiple times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/steam1.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3170640?t=1749389598","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749389598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/e123f98002f2cab1a25fd5945f935c5f6742a858/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749389598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/e123f98002f2cab1a25fd5945f935c5f6742a858/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749389598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game is set in an orphanage in Eastern Europe in the 1980s, where players take on the role of orphans who are being persecuted by a satanic sect that wants to sacrifice them for its own dark purposes. The game relies heavily on atmosphere, secrets and the players' fears. There is no explicit sexual content or direct depictions of violence. However, the game does contain slightly disfigured corpses, grotesque and repulsive monsters and the players' fallen avatars. The game does not show any direct rituals that could indicate child abuse. The interactions between the monsters and the players contain mild violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3762440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of orphans trapped in a sinister orphanage, set in Cold War-era Eastern Europe. They have to escape, before they are sacrificed by a ruthless cult attempting to summon Moloch, the Child Eater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/GIF_SOLVE_PUZZLES_TOGETHER.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ce_key_features.png?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer survival horror for 1-6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic escape room mechanics where every session is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hallucinatory horror engine that blurs reality and fear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three-phase gameplay: Phase 1: main building (demo) -&gt; Phase 2: wings -&gt; Phase 3: forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hostile enemies: turned priests, nuns, s\u00e9ance monsters, Child Eater</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character progression &amp; lore will unlock over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic 1980s eastern bloc environment, featuring pop-cultural and Cold War collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural puzzle-chain system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/GIF_HORROR_MONSTERS_SURVIVAL_COOP_MULTIPLAYER.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ce_game_objectives.png?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the orphanage</strong> before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay low, stay quiet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find clues, solve puzzles, and unlock the path to freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up and survive the horror together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/steamcoop.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ce_story.png?t=1749389598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is set in Eastern Europe in the early 1980s. The orphans (players) must figure out how to escape alive from an orphanage that harbors terrible, evil secrets. The caretakers, priests and nuns, are members of a satanic cult and the time has come for the final s\u00e9ance where all the orphans are to be sacrificed to unleash demonic forces on the world and bring demonic power to earth by the &quot;Child Eater&quot;. Secret story elements are revealed by playing through the game multiple times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/steam1.gif?t=1749389598\" /></p>","developers":["Uncle George Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/ced3a9d5745c670c1dbdf80932b9ac7a12b95efe/header.jpg?t=1749389598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150950,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150950/movie480.mp4?t=1749112446","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150950/movie_max.mp4?t=1749112446"},"name":"Cult of the Child Eater: Steam Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150950/506adaea3771b95f6fb7658ace0c9e263f05d95a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749112446","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150950/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749112446","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150950/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749112446"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257048576,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257048576/movie480.mp4?t=1724791757","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257048576/movie_max.mp4?t=1724791757"},"name":"Cult of the Child Eater: Official Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257048576/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1724791757","webm":{"480":"http://video.akam